  "description": "Built to order - most sizes are currently available to purchase, with quick turnaround for pickup or delivery.\nOur beautiful Rachel step-through frame, named for the street where our flagship store is located, is back with a few improvements! Some people were using their original-run Rachels for full-on four-pannier international touring, and while the original spec was just fine for such endeavours, we decided to make some changes to make such adventures a bit easier: beefed-up tubing, more tire clearance, longer wheelbase and raised front-end for more comfort, and a few new eyelets here and there.\nStep-throughs also make for great cargo haulers. Those extra tubes in the rear triangle reduce flex, and stepping through a frame will almost always look better than swinging a leg over a loaded diamond frame, which can be cumbersome and isn't always elegant.\nThe two smaller sizes are still designed around 26\" wheels, while the two larger sizes use 700c wheels. Available in two magnificent new colours, Fondue (brown) and Monet (glue-grey).\nThe bicycle may look slightly different from the current picture. For technical reasons, screen colours can never perfectly reproduce paint colours, so please be prepared for slight variations from what is displayed.",
